<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN ONE BLN 91-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN ONE BLN 91-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell one billion zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills on</p>
<p>Tuesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - August 12, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - November 11, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
